WEBVTT

00:01.251 --> 00:06.715
Over a century ago, beings that prey
on humans suddenly appeared.

00:08.967 --> 00:13.805
Their overwhelming strength

00:14.472 --> 00:18.143
quickly pushed humanity
to the brink of extinction.

00:20.812 --> 00:27.193
The surviving humans constructed
three walls, Maria, Rose, and Sina,

00:27.402 --> 00:30.280
which brought them a century of peace.

00:30.905 --> 00:31.906
However...

02:11.464 --> 02:16.803
The Titan assault on Trost District
resulted in many casualties,

02:17.512 --> 02:20.932
owing to the fact that the elite
Scout Regiment was absent at the time.

02:23.184 --> 02:28.439
They had just left that morning
on a scouting mission outside.

02:31.568 --> 02:34.487
It's here! The main unit
of the Scout Regiment!

02:35.655 --> 02:38.867
Commander Erwin!
Give those Titans a real thrashing!

02:40.076 --> 02:42.078
Look! It's Captain Levi!

02:42.787 --> 02:45.456
They say he's as mighty
as an entire brigade!

02:46.082 --> 02:48.042
Talk about annoying...

02:48.918 --> 02:54.883
If their looks of envy catch sight
of how fussy you are, it will crush them.

03:00.847 --> 03:03.766
The Titans await outside...

03:04.559 --> 03:07.812
I wonder what kind we'll see this time!

03:08.062 --> 03:12.650
I hope we find some Abnormals!
That would be great!

03:12.734 --> 03:15.028
I would say there's already
an Abnormal right here.

03:15.111 --> 03:16.654
What? Where?

03:18.865 --> 03:19.866
Here.

03:20.366 --> 03:21.451
Move out!

03:23.912 --> 03:28.499
Scouting the exterior
and establishing bases for expansion.

03:29.042 --> 03:31.711
Entrusted with these duties,

03:31.794 --> 03:34.213
the Scout Regiment stands
at the apex of humankind's knowledge.

03:35.089 --> 03:36.883
Survival rates have increased dramatically

03:36.966 --> 03:39.886
thanks to the resourcefulness
of some members,

03:40.762 --> 03:44.807
but excursions into Titan territory
still result

03:45.141 --> 03:48.228
in casualties exceeding 30 percent.

03:49.062 --> 03:54.651
That's simply how powerful the Titans are
compared to humans.

03:55.818 --> 03:58.863
Just you wait...

03:59.822 --> 04:01.741
Humanity is...

04:03.076 --> 04:05.078
going to destroy you all!

04:05.578 --> 04:07.580
The last ones standing

04:07.664 --> 04:08.998
will be us!

04:14.379 --> 04:17.507
Just you wait...

04:18.633 --> 04:20.468
Captain Levi is going to...

04:34.065 --> 04:35.316
One on the right.

04:36.317 --> 04:37.860
Two on the left.

04:38.152 --> 04:40.697
Captain! I've gathered reinforcements!

04:40.905 --> 04:43.741
Petra. Tend to the soldier below.

04:44.075 --> 04:46.077
The rest of you,
take the one on the right.

04:46.411 --> 04:48.413
I'll handle the ones on the left.

04:49.038 --> 04:50.039
Captain!

05:00.133 --> 05:01.634
It's okay!

05:02.135 --> 05:05.138
I won't hurt you! I promise!

05:09.475 --> 05:10.727
Nice try!

05:10.810 --> 05:12.312
Now it's my turn!

05:12.395 --> 05:14.272
There you go!

05:16.649 --> 05:19.068
See? That didn't hurt.

05:20.570 --> 05:22.947
Every single one of you...

05:26.326 --> 05:28.828
looks as funny as hell.

05:43.968 --> 05:45.470
Just simmer down.

05:46.429 --> 05:48.389
Otherwise, I might have trouble...

05:50.349 --> 05:52.477
cutting your flesh cleanly off.

06:03.237 --> 06:04.655
How filthy...

06:14.415 --> 06:15.416
Captain!

06:15.792 --> 06:18.461
I can't get the bleeding to stop!

06:22.048 --> 06:24.133
Captain...

06:28.679 --> 06:29.597
Yes?

06:31.099 --> 06:33.434
Was I...

06:34.018 --> 06:38.689
helpful to humanity at all?

06:40.441 --> 06:44.612
Am I going to die without having been...

06:45.071 --> 06:46.906
any help at all?

06:50.868 --> 06:53.538
You achieved many great things.

06:53.871 --> 06:56.749
And you'll continue to.

06:57.500 --> 07:01.879
The resolve you leave behind
will give me strength.

07:03.256 --> 07:04.674
I promise you.

07:04.924 --> 07:08.511
I will put an end to the Titans,
without fail!

07:10.888 --> 07:11.973
Captain...

07:13.099 --> 07:14.642
He's already...

07:20.064 --> 07:23.109
Did he hear it all?

07:23.568 --> 07:26.696
Yes. I'm sure he heard you.

07:27.155 --> 07:31.451
He's resting with
a look of relief on his face.

07:34.078 --> 07:35.329
That's good, then.

07:37.123 --> 07:38.040
Levi!

07:39.625 --> 07:40.626
We're pulling out!

07:41.127 --> 07:42.962
- What?
- Pulling out?

07:43.296 --> 07:45.506
But we can still go further!

07:45.965 --> 07:47.717
My men will have died for nothing!

07:48.092 --> 07:51.512
A swarm of Titans has begun
moving northward, toward the city.

07:54.515 --> 07:56.142
This is just like what happened
five years ago.

07:56.684 --> 07:58.311
Something's happening in town.

07:58.769 --> 08:01.606
It's possible that
the wall has been destroyed.

08:04.233 --> 08:05.651
Damn...

08:09.405 --> 08:10.656
Damn...

08:40.603 --> 08:43.898
This... This can't be happening!

08:44.857 --> 08:47.818
We're nothing like we were five years ago.

08:48.361 --> 08:49.904
We trained so hard...

08:50.488 --> 08:52.240
We studied so hard...

08:54.283 --> 08:56.369
To beat these things...

08:57.495 --> 09:00.289
To survive against them...

09:00.581 --> 09:01.874
Hot...

09:02.750 --> 09:04.168
It's hot...

09:04.961 --> 09:06.546
Help me...

09:07.129 --> 09:08.422
Mom...

09:09.840 --> 09:11.050
Mom...

09:13.928 --> 09:15.096
Mom...

09:19.350 --> 09:20.560
Mom...

09:23.396 --> 09:25.189
Help me...

09:26.691 --> 09:28.317
How did things turn out this way?

09:29.068 --> 09:31.904
Why has everything been taken from us?

09:32.572 --> 09:33.864
Our lives...

09:34.448 --> 09:35.700
Our dreams...

09:37.702 --> 09:38.911
Why?

09:45.751 --> 09:46.919
Damn it!

09:47.336 --> 09:48.921
Damn it!

09:50.131 --> 09:52.383
I refuse to give up!

09:52.717 --> 09:56.721
I'll drive them all out! Every last one!

09:58.306 --> 10:01.559
By my own hand!

10:56.280 --> 10:58.866
I'll drive you out...

10:59.867 --> 11:01.369
from this world...

11:05.748 --> 11:07.625
Every last one of you!

11:14.799 --> 11:16.133
More...

11:16.759 --> 11:18.094
More!

11:18.761 --> 11:20.388
Kill more!

11:20.638 --> 11:22.139
I want to kill!

11:25.434 --> 11:28.813
More... I'm going to...

11:29.230 --> 11:30.648
kill more of you.

11:35.319 --> 11:36.320
Eren?

11:50.042 --> 11:50.876
Eren!

11:52.211 --> 11:54.630
Eren! Can you move on your own?

11:54.880 --> 11:56.215
Are you yourself?

11:56.549 --> 11:58.884
Tell them everything you know!

11:59.135 --> 12:00.678
I'm sure they'll understand!

12:02.388 --> 12:04.014
- Armin?
- Did you hear him?

12:04.098 --> 12:05.808
He said he's going to kill us!

12:06.267 --> 12:08.310
Yes, I heard it too.

12:08.519 --> 12:10.980
He's planning on eating us!

12:12.106 --> 12:14.567
What are they all talking about?

12:15.401 --> 12:18.946
Are they pointing those swords at us?

12:19.947 --> 12:23.242
But they're meant for killing Titans!

12:24.118 --> 12:26.370
Why are they looking at me like that?

12:28.622 --> 12:31.625
What's going on here?

12:38.257 --> 12:41.218
You cadets will prep up
and remain on standby!

12:41.302 --> 12:42.136
WITHIN WALL ROSE

12:43.262 --> 12:49.268
And that's how we got hold of
some gas and got out of Trost.

12:50.686 --> 12:51.937
You went through all that?

12:52.605 --> 12:53.689
I'm sorry.

12:53.939 --> 12:57.693
We kept volunteering
to help supply you guys, but...

12:57.985 --> 13:01.739
We even managed to secure some gas, too.

13:01.989 --> 13:06.911
Does that mean
everyone who isn't here is...

13:07.495 --> 13:08.329
Yes...

13:10.372 --> 13:11.999
Even Mikasa?

13:12.500 --> 13:17.213
No, I'm pretty sure she came after us,
with Jean and the rest.

13:17.880 --> 13:21.050
Jean. Don't tell me
Mikasa got hurt or something?

13:23.093 --> 13:25.095
Hey. What's wrong?

13:30.976 --> 13:34.104
I can't tell you. We've been slapped
with a confidentiality order.

13:35.689 --> 13:37.816
- A confidentiality order?
- That's crazy.

13:38.651 --> 13:41.737
There's no way
it's staying under wraps, though.

13:42.404 --> 13:45.658
The news is going to spread
across mankind like wildfire.

13:47.409 --> 13:50.663
Assuming mankind
lasts long enough, anyway.

13:53.082 --> 13:56.418
That's pretty smart of
the Corps of Engineers,

13:56.502 --> 13:58.504
using the Titans themselves as
a defensive wall of flesh.

13:59.296 --> 14:01.966
But we can't afford to let our guard down.

14:03.050 --> 14:06.679
After all, we're standing
on the cliff's edge,

14:06.762 --> 14:08.931
the front lines in the battle
between humanity and the Titans.

14:09.640 --> 14:10.641
What's the matter?

14:11.267 --> 14:14.270
Oh, no, nothing's wrong with our mission.

14:15.020 --> 14:18.899
I'm just worried about my friends
assigned to the vanguard.

14:19.400 --> 14:22.486
I just saw a messenger headed for HQ
with a pale look on his face...

14:23.153 --> 14:23.988
Yes.

14:24.405 --> 14:26.615
But our only focus should be
on fending them off,

14:26.782 --> 14:28.784
just as we were originally trained.

14:30.494 --> 14:34.498
I heard you helped three children
escape five years ago,

14:34.957 --> 14:36.959
and that they're cadets now.

14:37.501 --> 14:38.836
Are they part of the vanguard too?

14:39.587 --> 14:40.421
Yes...

14:41.630 --> 14:44.675
I apologize.
I shouldn't have brought it up.

14:44.758 --> 14:45.676
They're fine.

14:46.802 --> 14:48.137
They're tough kids.

14:48.470 --> 14:50.890
They each have what it takes to survive.

14:51.348 --> 14:53.767
One's a proficient fighter.

14:54.101 --> 14:56.604
Another has immense inner strength.

14:56.770 --> 15:00.399
And the other is extremely intelligent.

15:01.066 --> 15:03.569
They're all right. They're alive for sure.

15:05.613 --> 15:09.742
Cadets Jaeger, Ackermann, and Arlelt!

15:10.034 --> 15:13.412
What you've committed is
an act of treason!

15:13.913 --> 15:16.790
Whether you live or die depends on you!

15:17.124 --> 15:17.958
What?

15:18.375 --> 15:22.046
Should you try anything funny or
attempt to move from where you are,

15:22.212 --> 15:25.966
we'll blast you to bits immediately
and without hesitation!

15:26.550 --> 15:27.468
What?

15:27.760 --> 15:29.094
This is a direct question!

15:29.887 --> 15:31.722
What are you really?

15:32.681 --> 15:35.017
Human? Or Titan?

15:37.186 --> 15:39.188
What kind of question is that?

15:40.189 --> 15:41.732
What's with that look?

15:42.942 --> 15:45.694
It's almost like they're looking
at some kind of monster...

15:47.237 --> 15:48.989
Is that what they think of me?

15:50.449 --> 15:52.993
I don't understand the question, sir!

15:53.827 --> 15:55.663
Playing innocent, are you?

15:55.913 --> 15:58.582
Just try that again, you monster!

15:58.916 --> 16:00.834
We'll blast you to pieces
in the blink of an eye

16:00.918 --> 16:04.463
before you can reveal your true form!

16:04.922 --> 16:05.839
True form?

16:06.173 --> 16:08.467
Scores of people witnessed the moment

16:09.176 --> 16:13.222
that you appeared
from the body of a Titan!

16:14.348 --> 16:21.188
We've allowed you, an unknown being,
to infiltrate Wall Rose!

16:21.814 --> 16:26.026
Even if you are a member of the Cadets
as sanctioned by the King,

16:26.193 --> 16:29.113
it is well within reason for me to get rid
of any danger as quickly as possible!

16:29.530 --> 16:31.490
Of this, I feel certain!

16:32.449 --> 16:36.036
The Armored Titan
that took down Wall Maria

16:36.120 --> 16:38.330
could appear at any moment now!

16:38.831 --> 16:43.043
As we speak, the survival
of humanity itself is at stake!

16:43.335 --> 16:44.336
Understand?

16:44.586 --> 16:49.174
We can't afford to waste
any further manpower or time on you!

16:49.883 --> 16:54.555
I will bombard you
with high explosives if I have to!

16:54.972 --> 16:59.059
Indeed, their defiance is obvious.

16:59.560 --> 17:02.479
It's unlikely we'll get
any beneficial information from them.

17:03.188 --> 17:06.525
As you said, this is a waste
of time and manpower.

17:06.984 --> 17:07.901
Sir!

17:08.110 --> 17:09.403
Now is our best chance!

17:09.987 --> 17:12.948
We should destroy him
while he's still in human form!

17:13.741 --> 17:15.159
My specialty...

17:15.993 --> 17:18.579
is severing flesh.

17:19.913 --> 17:23.083
I'll gladly demonstrate it if need be.

17:23.751 --> 17:26.253
If anyone wants to
experience my technique...

17:27.379 --> 17:30.507
then please, by all means, step this way.

17:32.134 --> 17:32.968
Sir.

17:33.594 --> 17:37.848
Mikasa Ackermann was assigned to
escort duty with us elite soldiers.

17:38.390 --> 17:41.643
Her prowess is equal to that
of a hundred ordinary soldiers.

17:41.894 --> 17:44.855
Losing her would be
a great setback for humanity.

17:45.147 --> 17:47.608
Hey, Mikasa! Armin!

17:47.900 --> 17:49.068
What is all this?

17:49.151 --> 17:50.069
Mikasa!

17:50.402 --> 17:52.196
Attacking people won't help!

17:52.654 --> 17:55.824
There's nowhere to run
inside this cramped wall!

17:56.742 --> 18:01.163
I don't care who it is.
I won't let anyone kill Eren.

18:01.622 --> 18:03.624
That's all that matters!

18:03.707 --> 18:05.167
Let's talk this out!

18:05.250 --> 18:08.170
None of them understand the situation!

18:08.545 --> 18:10.672
That's why fear's spreading among them!

18:11.882 --> 18:15.219
Am I the only one
who doesn't think I'm a Titan?

18:15.552 --> 18:18.472
Damn! I have no memory of how I got here!

18:20.390 --> 18:23.936
I'm too weak to stand, and I could end up
dead if I say the wrong thing.

18:24.895 --> 18:26.647
Being killed by humans?

18:27.272 --> 18:28.941
That's insane!

18:30.484 --> 18:36.073
What is this about me coming out
of a Titan's body, anyway?

18:36.657 --> 18:39.368
What the hell are they talking about?
How is that possible?

18:39.701 --> 18:41.703
Does that mean it wasn't a dream?

18:43.497 --> 18:44.665
If that's the case...

18:45.374 --> 18:48.585
that means I grew an arm
where my sleeve was severed!

18:49.670 --> 18:52.089
That practically makes me a Titan!

18:52.756 --> 18:54.299
That's impossible...

18:55.008 --> 18:56.426
How could I...

18:56.802 --> 18:57.636
How?

18:57.719 --> 18:59.179
I'll ask one more time!

18:59.596 --> 19:01.723
What are you really?

19:04.810 --> 19:07.229
I can't answer this wrong.

19:07.771 --> 19:10.107
I won't be the only one who will die.

19:11.316 --> 19:13.777
Yes, I've always been...

19:15.529 --> 19:17.030
the same as you!

19:18.782 --> 19:19.867
I'm human!

19:30.627 --> 19:31.962
I see.

19:32.713 --> 19:34.464
Don't take this personally.

19:37.176 --> 19:39.011
This is just how it has to be.

19:39.553 --> 19:42.598
Because no one can prove...

19:43.974 --> 19:46.393
that they aren't a monster.

19:49.855 --> 19:51.148
Eren! Armin!

19:51.315 --> 19:52.482
Head up the wall!

19:52.691 --> 19:53.692
Stop!

20:00.866 --> 20:01.700
Eren.

20:03.619 --> 20:06.663
When I get back,
I'll show you the basement

20:06.747 --> 20:08.498
that I've kept secret all this time.

20:11.251 --> 20:15.505
Keep this key on you at all times.

20:16.215 --> 20:19.468
And every time you see it, remember.

20:20.385 --> 20:23.513
Remember that
you must visit that basement!

20:26.308 --> 20:30.604
This injection will
make you forget all of this,

20:31.063 --> 20:34.858
so there's no use explaining now.

20:35.317 --> 20:36.235
Listen.

20:36.610 --> 20:40.447
You must retake Wall Maria
and reach the basement!

20:41.907 --> 20:45.577
I'm certain this ability will help
when that time comes!

20:46.912 --> 20:50.582
Their memories will tell you
how to use it!

20:51.208 --> 20:52.292
Eren!

20:54.586 --> 20:57.839
You'll understand the truth someday
if you visit the basement!

20:58.924 --> 21:01.343
It will be a harsh, painful journey,

21:01.551 --> 21:03.637
but you must reach it!

21:07.849 --> 21:11.395
If you want to save Mikasa, Armin,
and everyone else...

21:11.770 --> 21:16.108
you must learn to control this ability!

21:42.134 --> 21:43.302
Did we get him?

21:55.897 --> 21:57.149
This can't be...

23:43.463 --> 23:49.469
"Eren isn't humanity's enemy,"
Armin desperately pleads.

23:49.761 --> 23:53.348
But the Garrison Regiment,
consumed by fear and abandoning all logic,

23:53.557 --> 23:55.934
makes the decision to execute Eren.
